<title>USA: St Paul hogs off 0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off 0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Friday, were $0.50 lower. Top $56.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	  220-250 lbs     56.50</p>
<p>			250-260 lbs     56.00-56.50</p>
<p>			260-270 lbs     55.00-56.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3	  270-280 lbs     54.00-55.00</p>
<p>    US 2-4	  280-290 lbs     53.00-54.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4	  290-300 lbs     52.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $0.50. Top $48.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    45.50</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    46.50-47.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
</text>
